/S/Span<</ActualText(  \\label {eq:backward_stream_recursive} \\begin {split} \\mathbf {T}^{c}_{i} &= \\mathbf {T}^{s_{0}}_{i} = \\textbf {Up}_{5 - i} \\left \( \\mathbf {P}^{s_{0}}_{i} \\right \) + \\mathbf {T}^{s_{1}}_{i} \\\\ &= \\left [ \\textbf {Up}_{5 - i} \\left \( \\mathbf {P}^{s_{0}}_{i} \\right \) + \\textbf {Up}_{5 - i} \\left \( \\mathbf {P}^{s_{1}}_{i} \\right \) \\right ] + \\mathbf {T}^{s_{2}}_{i} = \\cdots \\\\ &= \\sum _{l = 0}^{L} \\textbf {Up}_{5 - i} \\left \( \\mathbf {P}^{s_{l}}_{i} \\right \) \\end {split} )>>BDC
